    <!-- One-time explainer shown on first launch only -->
    <string name="onboarding_title">How Wishy Browser works</string>
    <string name="onboarding_message">Type in the search bar to search or open a site.\n\nThe sidebar on the left has back, home, save-page ★, your saved pages, the pointer and the menu.\n\nThe pointer is ON by default: the D-pad moves it, OK clicks, and pushing it to the top or left edge jumps to the search bar or sidebar. Press MENU to switch it off for TV-optimized sites.\n\nBack goes back a page, then exits.\n\nThis is shown once and won\'t appear again.</string>
